 = x, y = y, z = z }  ✅ \\u003c/pre\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e- makeDimensi3 menerima tiga argumen x, y, z.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e- Menggunakan record constructor { x = x, y = y, z = z } untuk membuat nilai bertipe Dimensi3.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"point_gained\":10,\"question_id\":21,\"user_answer_id\":131,\"user_answer_index\":3}',1,100,30,10,NULL,'2025-03-26 04:47:28','2025-03-26 04:47:28'),(4474,22,87,'{\"correct_answer_id\":135,\"correct_answer_index\":3,\"exp_gained\":10,\"feedback\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eApa Itu Tipe Rekursif?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTipe dikatakan \\u003cstrong\\u003erekursif\\u003c/strong\\u003e jika didefinisikan dengan \\u003cstrong\\u003emengacu pada dirinya sendiri\\u003c/strong\\u003e dalam definisi tipe tersebut.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"point_gained\":3,\"question_id\":22,\"user_answer_id\":135,\"user_answer_index\":3}',1,100,10,3,NULL,'2025-03-26 04:47:38','2025-03-26 04:47:38'),(4475,18,62,'{\"correct_answer_id\":118,\"correct_answer_index\":2,\"exp_gained\":20,\"feedback\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eSubtitusi nilai a=9, b=3, c=13 masing masing :\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ei \\u003cstrong\\u003eBaca (a, b, c)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003ea = 9, b = 3, c = 13\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eii \\u003cstrong\\u003eJika a ≥ b maka x ← a, y ← b\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eKarena \\u003cstrong\\u003e9 ≥ 3\\u003c/strong\\u003e, maka \\u003cstrong\\u003ex = 9\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ey = 3\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eiv.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003eJika c ≥ x maka x ← c\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eKarena \\u003cstrong\\u003e13 ≥ 9\\u003c/strong\\u003e, maka \\u003cstrong\\u003ex = 13\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ev.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003eJika c 